**Summary:**

Adding a temporary ignore for CVE-2026-114613 (HIGH) detected in the Python `msgpack` package during the Jenkins Docker image vulnerability scan.

**Ignore Reason:**

This ignore is being added for a HIGH-severity vulnerability detected in the `msgpack` Python package. We have already updated the package requirement to
the fixed version (`msgpack>=1.2.3`) in both the `ib-python312` and `ib-python314` base images. However, the vulnerability scan continues to report the older version (`1.1.2`)
despite the dependency updates. We are temporarily ignoring this finding while we investigate why the scanner continues to detect the outdated version.
The ignore will be reviewed and removed once the underlying issue is resolved and the vulnerability is no longer detected.
